flowchart TD

Scheduler[Cron Scheduler]

Scheduler --> BackupJob

BackupJob --> PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL)]

PostgreSQL --> Dump[Database Dump]

Dump --> Compress[Compress Backup]

Compress --> Encrypt[Encrypt Backup]

Encrypt --> Storage[(Object Storage)]

Storage --> Verify[Verify Backup]

Verify --> Success{Verification Passed?}

Success -- Yes --> Complete([Backup Complete])

Success -- No --> Alert[Notify Operations Team]